tel 1.0 propensive.dev/bolt

# Bolt codes of Soundness: `subdivision 118` / `error 1` is ↯/s.118.1. A subdivision is a
# module, numbered so that each comes after those it depended on when it was numbered; a new
# module takes the next number. An error named for a class is that `fulminate.Error`; one
# without a name is reported by a macro, with `halt`. Each has a page in Soundness's
# doc/errors, which lists its variants.

project s soundness

